      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261226">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261231">AVX</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261233">Return the bitwise logical AND of packed single precision floating-point values in xmm2 and xmm3/mem. </para>
      </td>
