     <td><para unique="1261242">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261247">AVX</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261249">Return the bitwise logical AND of packed single precision floating-point values in ymm2 and ymm3/mem.</para>
